      "content": "# METADATA\n# title: Cost-center tag required on resource-group\n# description: |\n#   Every resource-group MUST carry a `cost_center` tag so spend is\n#   attributable.\n# custom:\n#   rule_id: resource-group.cost-center-tag.required\n#   severity: low\n#   category: config_drift\npackage fdai.resource_group.cost_center_tag_required\n\nimport rego.v1\n\ndefault deny := false\n\nrequired_tag := t if {\n  t := input.parameters.tag_name\n} else := \"cost_center\"\n\ndeny if {\n  input.resource.type == \"resource-group\"\n  not input.resource.props.tags[required_tag]\n}\n\ndeny_reason := sprintf(\"missing_required_tag:%s\", [required_tag]) if deny\n"
    }
  ]
